<section id="about" class="section-service" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-about;"><!--[--><div class="service-about u-bg-primary hygiene-page__about"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="scroll-block"><div class="scroll-block__overlay"></div><div class="scroll-block__content scroll-block-grid"><div class="scroll-block-grid__header"><div class="scroll-block-progress"><div class="scroll-block-progress__fill"></div></div><h2 class="scroll-block__title u-text-headings-medium">It is recommended to visit a dental hygienist twice a year, especially if you:</h2></div><div class="scroll-block-grid__body"><div class="scroll-block__items"><!--[--><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Want to improve your teeth tone</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– A professional deep clean naturally brightens your teeth by up to a full shade.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Want to keep your teeth in tip-top shape</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Great daily brushing combined with a proper professional clean is the absolute best preventative care.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Notice sore or bleeding gums?</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– If you have problems with your gums, a hygienist is the first professional you should visit.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Suffer from bad breath?</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Want to say goodbye to bad breath? A visit to the hygienist leaves your mouth feeling incredibly fresh and clean.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Want to boost your overall health?</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Your mouth is home to tons of bacteria that can impact your immune system and especially the digestive system.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Irregular tooth brushing.</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Our hygienist cleans all those tricky, hard-to-reach places, making sure not just teeth, but your entire mouth feels fresh and immaculate.</div></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-price u-bg-primary hygiene-page__price"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="callout u-bg-secondary apply-callout"><div class="callout__body"><!--[--><!--[--><h2 class="u-text-headings-small service-price__title">Professional dental and oral hygiene today</h2><p class="u-text-body-medium">As a BONUS, receive a free consultation for professional teeth whitening (worth €40)</p><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__aside"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="service-price__prices"><!----><span class="service-price__price service-price__price--new u-text-headings-medium">Only €110</span></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__cta"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="reveal-block service-apply u-bg-primary service-apply--layout-alternate hygiene-page__apply"><div class="reveal-block__content"><div class="reveal-block__header u-bg-primary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><p class="reveal-block__title u-text-headings-large"><span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">Experience</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">the</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">very</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">best</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">in</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">next-gen</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">dental</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">cleaning</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">tech</span><span class="sr-only" style="position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0px; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0px, 0px, 0px, 0px); white-space: nowrap; border: 0px;">Experience the very best in next-gen dental cleaning tech</span></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="reveal-block__body u-bg-secondary" style="background-color:#031C14;"><div class="reveal-block__bg"><canvas class="lava-bg-illustration reveal-block__bg-illustration" width="1920" height="1230"></canvas><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><p class="reveal-block__title reveal-block__title--bg u-text-headings-large">Experience the very best in next-gen dental cleaning tech</p><!--]--></div></div><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="reveal-block__main-wrap"><div class="reveal-block__main"><!--[--><div class="service-apply-grid"><div class="service-apply-grid__item service-apply-box u-bg-secondary"><div class="service-apply-box__aside"><div class="video-dialog video-dialog--type-cover service-apply-box__preview"><video class="video-dialog__preview" width="300" height="534" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" src="/cms/api/media/file/hygiene-apply-tease.webm" autoplay=""></video><button aria-label="Play video" class="video-dialog__button"><div class="icon-button icon-button--type-primary icon-button--size-medium video-dialog__play-button"><div class="icon-button__icon"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 54 54"><path fill="currentColor" d="M22.031 19.687a1 1 0 0 1 1.515-.858l12.188 7.313a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.715L23.546 35.17a1 1 0 0 1-1.515-.857V19.687Z"></path></svg><!--]--></div></div></button><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></div></div><div class="service-apply-box__body"><p class="u-text-headings-small">Experience the very best in next-gen dental cleaning tech</p><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end service-apply-box__cta-button"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="reveal-block__timeline"><div class="reveal-block__timeline-item reveal-block__timeline-item--intro"></div><div class="reveal-block__timeline-item reveal-block__timeline-item--main"></div></div></div><div class="service-when u-bg-primary hygiene-page__when"><div class="list-block list-block--visible"><div class="list-block__header u-bg-primary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><h2 class="list-block__title u-text-headings-large">Why choose LAVA dental studio for your clean?</h2><div class="list-block__header-photos"><!--[--><img width="630" height="410" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/aa9bb355e2fb-5.avif 1x, /assets/img/3c9508ddad64-5.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" class="list-block__header-photo" style="--delay:0s;" src="/assets/img/aa9bb355e2fb-5.avif"><img width="630" height="410" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/8609c9733850-6.avif 1x, /assets/img/034344ae5b62-6.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" class="list-block__header-photo" style="--delay:0.2s;" src="/assets/img/8609c9733850-6.avif"><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="list-block__body u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><ul class="list-block__items"><!--[--><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.4s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">01</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">The atmosphere</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">An atmosphere unlike any other dental clinic in Latvia. Our studio interior is designed to help you unwind and forget about the stress or fear often associated with dental hygiene visits.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.6000000000000001s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">02</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">A procedure just like a luxury spa treatment</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">We think dental hygiene should feel like a spa treat. It gently pampers your teeth and gums, leaving them sparkling and protected against disease.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.8s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">03</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Netflix in the hygienist’s chair</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Oh yes! Lean back and enjoy your favourite series or music while our hygienist takes care of the rest.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:1s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">04</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Top-tier tech and highly-qualified specialists</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">We only use state-of-the-art dental tech, and our hygienists genuinely love what they do.</div></div></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="service-efficiency u-bg-secondary hygiene-page__efficiency"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="service-efficiency__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->The ultimate key to healthy teeth<!--]--></h2></div><div class="service-efficiency__body"><div class="image-info-box"><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--aside"><!--[--><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/96d2d8954a7d-3.avif 1x, /assets/img/21f24660c1ce-3.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded image-info-box__image image-info-box__image--visible" alt="Service Efficiency" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/96d2d8954a7d-3.avif"><!--]--></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--main"><div class="scroll-box"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-primary scroll-box__progress-bar"></div><div class="scroll-box__header"><p class="u-text-body-large">Keep your teeth clean and healthy by visiting a hygienist at least twice a year.</p><!----></div><div class="scroll-box__body"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><p>Unfortunately, a 2021 study showed that 41% of people in Latvia have never seen a hygienist, and 74% hadn’t been in the last year, often seeing it as an unnecessary luxury.</p>
<p>We want to change that mindset—it’s absolutely essential for everyone! It’s always smarter to spend a little on prevention now than a fortune on complex treatments later.</p>
</div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--footer"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-how u-bg-primary hygiene-page__how"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="service-how-grid"><div class="service-how-grid__item service-how-grid__item--header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->What to expect<!--]--></h2></div><div class="service-how-grid__item service-how-grid__item--body"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-secondary service-how__progress"></div><div class="service-how__items"><!--[--><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/ddf03bc99865-7.avif 1x, /assets/img/1e719489cea9-7.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/ddf03bc99865-7.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>1. The hygienist learns about your experience and habits.</h3>
<p>First, our hygienist will find out about your dental history and look at your current daily brushing routine.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/3cac3f36a3bf-8.avif 1x, /assets/img/37472141db8f-8.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/3cac3f36a3bf-8.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>2. A procedure tailored specifically to your needs</h3>
<p>At our clinic, all hygienists use the very latest Swiss-made EMS AIRFLOW MASTER. This clever bit of tech automatically tweaks the pressure and ultrasonic power, using a gentle, totally painless glycine powder to clear away plaque, staining, and tartar.</p>
<p>This technology ensures that neither the tooth enamel nor the soft tissues are damaged, as can sometimes happen with standard dental hygiene methods, where the results often depend on the specialist’s professionalism and experience.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/83f3aa291624-9.avif 1x, /assets/img/44a15da5321e-9.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/83f3aa291624-9.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>3. Netflix &amp; Chill</h3>
<p>While we work on your teeth, you can just pop on some tunes or catch up on your favourite Netflix show on our ceiling-mounted TVs.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/2533527e1918-10.avif 1x, /assets/img/f297d25751aa-10.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/2533527e1918-10.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>4. Fluoride gel treatment for your teeth</h3>
<p>At the end of the procedure, we treat your teeth to a premium 5000ppm fluoride gel. This hardens your enamel, offers extra protection, and neutralises harmful mouth acids.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/977e7c5f988a-11.avif 1x, /assets/img/5ac5bce986ea-11.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/977e7c5f988a-11.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>5. Oral care recommendations</h3>
<p>We’ll handpick and recommend the absolute best toothbrush, toothpaste, floss, and mouthwash tailored to your mouth.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/899532281dbc-12.avif 1x, /assets/img/7203c1404d3a-12.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/899532281dbc-12.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>6. If the hygienist detects dental problems</h3>
<p>If our hygienist notices any early signs of decay or damage, they’ll let you know straight away so we can get you booked in with a dentist.</p>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!----></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-price u-bg-primary hygiene-page__price"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="callout u-bg-secondary apply-callout"><div class="callout__body"><!--[--><!--[--><h2 class="u-text-headings-small service-price__title">Professional dental and oral hygiene today</h2><p class="u-text-body-medium">As a BONUS, receive a free consultation for professional teeth whitening (worth €40)</p><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__aside"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="service-price__prices"><!----><span class="service-price__price service-price__price--new u-text-headings-medium">Only €110</span></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__cta"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section>
