height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><img src="/assets/img/e05ca2873721-05.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><img src="/assets/img/c5dac772c117-06.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><!--]--></div><div class="carousel-autoplay carousel-autoplay--paused image-carousel__controls" style="--autoplay-item-duration:5000ms;"><button class="carousel-autoplay__button" aria-label="Play carousel"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><g><path fill="currentColor" d="M16 14.741a1 1 0 0 1 1.504-.864l9.015 5.26a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.727l-9.015 5.259A1 1 0 0 1 16 25.259z"></path></g></svg></button><div class="carousel-autoplay__dots"><!--[--><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot--active carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 1"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 2"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 3"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 4"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 5"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 6"></button><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--main"><div class="scroll-box"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-primary scroll-box__progress-bar"></div><div class="scroll-box__header"><p class="u-text-body-large">In our care, you’ll receive not only treatment and a perfect smile, but also care, openness and support all the way to the result. Our mission is to change the perception of dentistry. </p><!----></div><div class="scroll-box__body"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><p>Music, ambiance and a finely designed interior together with a specially tailored atmosphere will enable you to experience a completely different dentistry — one that is comfortable, calm and inspiring.</p>
<p>We want your experience with us to be like flying in first class — personal, convenient and with no worries or stress.</p>
</div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--footer"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Book a visit<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section id="faq" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-faq;"><div class="faq u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="faq__header"><h2 class="u-text-headings-large">Before you start, you might want to know more.</h2></div><div class="faq__body"><div class="faq-categories"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title">Dental hygiene appointment</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">What is a dental hygienist and what do they do?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>A dental hygienist is a specialist who provides professional dental hygiene treatment. </p><p><br></p><p>Dental hygiene is a preventive dental procedure that plays a key role in maintaining good dental and gum health.                     </p><p><br></p><p>During a dental hygiene procedure, all hard-to-reach parts of the oral cavity are cleaned with special instruments and medical products, eliminating harmful plaque bacteria and tartar, which are the main factors causing dental and gum problems.                                             </p><p><br></p><p>After the procedure, teeth become cleaner and visibly brighter. If plaque and tartar are not removed, your risk of cavities increases, you may develop bad breath, and gum disease or other oral health problems may occur.                                    </p><p><br></p><p>Likewise, a hygienist can examine all hard-to-reach areas and assess whether damage has begun. The sooner dental issues are detected, the sooner the situation can be corrected, avoiding further decay, pain, high expenses or even tooth loss.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Are dental hygiene procedures really painless?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Absolutely! The hygienist will only clean your teeth and gums and will always check if you have sensitive teeth and apply an anaesthetic gel if necessary.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Why is it necessary to visit a hygienist once every six months?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Oral health depends on a daily oral care routine, but no matter how diligently we brush our teeth, it is impossible to completely remove all tartar and plaque at home. </p><p>Therefore, an appointment with a professional hygienist is recommended at least once every six months for a thorough cleaning, including access to hard-to-reach areas. </p><p><br></p><p>Why is this so important?  </p><p><br></p><ul class="list-bullet"><li class="" style="" value="1">Long-term dental and oral health — destroys bacteria and unwanted microorganisms that damage tooth enamel.                                   </li><li class="" style="" value="2">It can prevent bad breath — proper cleaning removes food particles and bacteria that produce harmful acids.            </li><li class="" style="" value="3">It can remove tartar, plaque and pigment stains — and your teeth will become lighter. After hygiene, it is guaranteed that teeth can become half a shade to one shade lighter.          </li><li class="" style="" value="4">It improves overall health — destroying bacteria that accumulate in gum pockets reduces the possibility that they could go deeper into the body and impact your health.    </li></ul><p><br></p><p>If you often drink coffee, tea, red wine or smoke and sometimes forget to brush your teeth, then in some cases we recommend visiting a hygienist even once every 3 months.  But of course, each case is individual.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.30000000000000004s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Are there any grounds for concern if my gums bleed when I brush my teeth?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>This is the first sign that you have gingivitis, so it is advisable to visit a dental hygienist.  </p><p><br></p><p>Gingivitis occurs when there is too much plaque on the tooth or tartar has formed, which irritates the gums.             </p><p><br></p><p>If your gums continue to bleed even after visiting the dental hygienist, then you may have another condition.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.4s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Does an appointment with a hygienist protect you against tooth decay?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Professional dental hygiene procedures (tooth polishing, fluoride application) prevent dental diseases, provided that the patient also takes care of their dental health on a daily basis.                               </p><p><br></p><p>By properly removing tartar and plaque and polishing the teeth, the dental hygienist can easily detect all hard-to-reach areas and assess whether damage has begun.             </p><p><br></p><p>The sooner it is detected, the sooner the situation can be corrected, avoiding further decay, pain, high expenses or even tooth loss. In our clinic, we also offer fluoride gel applications (and also varnish coatings, for a separate fee), which additionally strengthen and protect teeth on a daily basis.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.5s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">What is dental plaque and how is tartar formed?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><ul class="list-bullet"><li class="" style="" value="1">Soft dental plaque is the main cause of tooth decay and gum disease.                               </li><li class="" style="" value="2">Plaque contains millions of bacteria, because the oral cavity is an ideal environment for them to multiply (warmth, moisture).                          </li><li class="" style="" value="3">Sugar in food reacts with bacteria, forming acids that are destructive to tooth tissue and gums.                                                          </li><li class="" style="" value="4">If plaque is not removed for a long time, it begins to mineralize and tartar forms.             </li><li class="" style="" value="5">As a result, the gums gradually recede, gum pockets form and teeth may begin to loosen.</li></ul></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title">About the procedure</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">How long does the dental hygiene procedure at LAVA dental studio last?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>A full oral cavity and dental hygiene treatment takes approximately 1 hour and 15 minutes.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">What makes the Swiss-made hygiene machine EMS AIRFLOW MASTER special?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>EMS AIRFLOW MASTER offers a revolution in dental hygiene!                                        </p><p><br></p><p>EMS AIRFLOW MASTER is a device that automatically adjusts pressure, ultrasonic power and uses a special painless glycine powder to remove plaque, pigment and tartar as effectively and painlessly as possible.     </p><p><br></p><p>This technology ensures that your tooth enamel and soft tissues are not damaged, which can often happen cleaning teeth with standard hygiene methods, where the result depends on the professionalism and experience of the specialist.                                                 </p><p><br></p><p>Our hygienists have undergone training and are now certified in GBT therapy. This means that you are in safe and experienced hands, who will provide you with the highest quality.      </p><p><br></p><p>How will EMS AIRFLOW MASTER improve your hygiene experience?   </p><ul class="list-bullet"><li class="" style="" value="1">Maximum comfort procedure: less discomfort and pain, so you can feel calm and relaxed.</li><li class="" style="" value="2">Better dental health: effective plaque and tartar removal will help keep your teeth clean and healthy in the long term.                          </li><li class="" style="" value="3">Improved smile: clean and healthy teeth mean a more beautiful smile and more confidence. </li><li class="" style="" value="4">This new technology is a step towards even more comfortable and effective dental care! We are confident that our new EMS AIRFLOW MASTER device will significantly improve your dental hygiene experience.</li></ul></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title">About teeth whitening...</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">If I'm interested in teeth whitening, is this procedure suitable for me?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>First, we invite you to a consultation with our dental hygienist.                                                     </p><p><br></p><p>The specialist will assess the health of your oral cavity, because teeth whitening can only be performed on healthy teeth and healthy gums, and the teeth must be free of plaque and tartar, so two weeks before the teeth whitening procedure, you will also need to undergo a professional oral hygiene procedure.    </p><p>          </p><p>At LAVA dental studio, we use FLASH teeth whitening equipment, which can make teeth several shades lighter.    </p><p><br></p><p>When applying for hygiene, be sure to ask the specialist about the possibilities of teeth whitening, because it is the hygienist who is the specialist who deals with professional, safe and proven teeth whitening.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">How much does teeth whitening cost at LAVA dental studio?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>We use FLASH teeth whitening equipment, which is guaranteed to make your teeth several shades lighter. </p><p><br></p><p>The path to a whiter smile should begin with a consultation on whitening with a photo protocol — €40 </p><p><br></p><p>Professional teeth whitening FLASH — €400</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" style="--delay:0.30000000000000004s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title">Practical questions</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Do you accept insurance policies?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>We work with all insurance companies. If your insurance policy includes oral hygiene coverage, you can use this service at our clinic.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></section>
<section id="contacts" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-contacts;"><div class="contacts u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="contacts__header"><h2 class="u-text-headings-large">We are right here. </h2></div><div class="contacts__body"><div class="image-info-box"><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--aside"><!--[--><img width="740" height="627" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/1de9caf9aa9f-map.svg 1x, /assets/img/dd2271325196-map.svg 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image-info-box__image" alt="Map" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/1de9caf9aa9f-map.svg"><!--]--></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--main"><div class="scroll-box"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-primary scroll-box__progress-bar"></div><div class="scroll-box__header"><p class="u-text-body-large">Conveniently located to make your appointment even easier. With easy access for people with mobility impairments. </p><!----></div><div class="scroll-box__body"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><p>Our studio is located at Ausekļa Street 14, where there are parking spaces in Zone B. We will pay for your parking while you are at LAVA dental.</p>
</div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div></div><div class="contacts__footer"><img width="1290" height="590" data-nuxt-img="" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 100vw, (max-width: 1349px) 100vw, 1290px" srcset="/assets/img/6be9b9a04821-location.avif 320w, /assets/img/936863dc2c1a-location.avif 640w, /assets/img/9f7348037191-location.avif 1280w, /assets/img/99bea6f7b10f-location.avif 1290w, /assets/img/4bbb139df2cb-location.avif 2560w, /assets/img/b86bd4d1f5a0-location.avif 2580w" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image" alt="LAVA Dental Studio" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/b86bd4d1f5a0-location.avif"></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></main>
